&_nc_oc=AdqZAMOfjEt_g27aEYDNC6If9tsC2BOR1B-UGAoWfDoDUxvMBQG5wiearChgxQGQDoA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3n14BDykoQlF6Xbh3RTLBJ8S2W7ZYq1Y-4UlkWKjT45g&oe=69ECA27E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Kkca8HJt_gkQ7kNvwEptRdy&_nc_oc=AdoZ7v93IOgQh9xl1c9mMzkLlRDxgdftVCA5RN-x6AI2L5gnxb4YCPaWg2Lispj4tBA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2_EWpis8e-Sb4SfoU0CcsnTNxYDCp9s3_rWfa8cxv-hQ&oe=69ECB37C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qVHFJ3h2eIAQ7kNvwFwbuSm&_nc_oc=AdpNAsk0Wl91gHUvShXyrUF0E6Gkej_gC2t6mTJvVqmbaz0YL65xJZ9c3kWBuUroCvU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3El3QAt1LTzuysaVVPqlsZyqNXMuRn9hGosmupcF8vFQ&oe=69ECD207"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WrHJf6JuR9gQ7kNvwGtURBH&_nc_oc=Adr3cGn4mc6fwWFEifB6B2O189Svc9PK9HgxK2kj-KUutRqIb-yIeTTfc1mcuC8lbUA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3rcLO6IiUtU0NQM5zJWhfhJZLL-4E8WD-YQ7NQgOkQdg&oe=69ECBDD5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jiJqeT_vHQUQ7kNvwFCtvVT&_nc_oc=AdrX41odUUmgjrkv3LNJSchL2aMvFOF7rgBjy32AbUema525ypI392bDwuDQcOLORKc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2S1cjm76cXt4SZVmMMy7miaF6JjoC19h5z0Oi06r0XIQ&oe=69ECCA64"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.